# ffmpeg flags that depend on the ISA rather than the OS. Layered on top of
# common/ffmpeg-features.<platform> by ffmpeg_features <platform> aarch64.
#
# Intentionally near-empty: everything the desktop set enables is portable to
# aarch64 EXCEPT libsvtjpegxs, which is x86-only upstream (see
# common/ffmpeg-features.x86_64 for why). Nothing to add here yet -- the file
# exists so ffmpeg_features has a layer to read for this arch.
